          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కాపురం (kāpuraṁ) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1456 lists Telugu kāpuramu, \"dwelling, residence\", beside kāpu, \"a cultivator\"."
            }
          ]
