          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ముచ్చటించు (muccaṭiñcu) is built on ముచ్చట, \"a pleasant talk; a charming thing\", with the verb ending -ఇంచు; the origin of ముచ్చట is not settled."
